# Autodesk PROPRIETARY reference assemblies — NOT committed by default.
# They are fetched on demand by tools/fetch-autodesk-refs.sh (scp from the
# licensed Windows hosts). Only the text metadata in this dir is tracked.
#
# To switch to the "commit into this private repo" policy option (see README.md),
# delete the two ignore lines below and `git add` the DLLs.
*.dll
**/*.dll

# Keep the tracked metadata explicit (in case a broader ignore is added later).
!README.md
!MANIFEST.txt
!SHA256SUMS
!.gitignore
